  "html": "<p>1단계에서 <code>분류봇</code>이 <strong>URGENT인지 NORMAL인지</strong> 판단하게 했습니다.\n이제 그 판단에 따라 <strong>다른 길로 보냅니다.</strong></p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Start → 분류봇 → 긴급인가 ┬ if   → 긴급안내</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                          └ else → 일반안내</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"condition-블록-놓기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#condition-블록-놓기\" class=\"peer\">Condition 블록 놓기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>분류봇</code>을 클릭해 선택합니다.</strong></p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>Toolbar</code>의 <code>Blocks</code>에서 <code>Condition</code>을 클릭합니다.</strong></p><p><code>분류봇</code> 뒤에 놓이고 선이 이어집니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong>이름을 <code>긴급인가</code>로 바꿉니다.</strong></p></div></div>\n<p>캔버스의 <code>긴급인가</code> 카드를 보면 <strong><code>if</code></strong> 와 <strong><code>else</code></strong> 두 줄이 있고,\n각 줄의 오른쪽에 <strong>점이 하나씩</strong> 있습니다. 갈래마다 선이 따로 나갑니다.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"조건-적기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#조건-적기\" class=\"peer\">조건 적기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><code>긴급인가</code>를 클릭하면 조건을 적는 칸이 나옵니다.\n<strong><code>if</code></strong> 줄에 이렇게 적습니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;분류봇.content&gt;.includes(&#x27;URGENT&#x27;)</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>읽는 법</strong> — &quot;<code>분류봇</code>이 내놓은 글에 <code>URGENT</code>라는 말이 들어 있으면&quot; 이라는 뜻입니다.\n들어 있으면 <code>if</code> 쪽으로, 아니면 <code>else</code> 쪽으로 갑니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><code>&lt;분류봇.content&gt;</code> 부분은 <strong><code>&lt;</code> 를 입력해 목록에서 고르세요.</strong>\n이름을 직접 타이핑하면 오타가 나기 쉽고, 오타가 나면 조건이 늘 거짓이 됩니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"갈래마다-안내문-블록-만들기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#갈래마다-안내문-블록-만들기\" class=\"peer\">갈래마다 안내문 블록 만들기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>이제 갈래가 둘이니, 각각에 블록을 붙입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>Toolbar</code>에서 <code>Agent</code>를 캔버스 빈 곳으로 끌어다 놓습니다.</strong></p><p>이번에는 자동 연결이 아니라 <strong>직접 잇습니다.</strong> 이름을 <code>긴급안내</code>로 바꿉니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>긴급인가</code> 카드의 <code>if</code> 줄에 있는 점을 끌어 <code>긴급안내</code>에 놓습니다.</strong></p><p><code>if</code> 줄의 점이라는 것이 중요합니다. 다른 줄의 점에서 끌면 다른 조건에 붙습니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong>같은 방법으로 <code>Agent</code>를 하나 더 놓고 <code>일반안내</code>로 이름을 바꿉니다.</strong></p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>else</code> 줄의 점을 끌어 <code>일반안내</code>에 놓습니다.</strong></p></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong><code>else</code> 쪽을 빠뜨리지 마세요.</strong> 이어 두지 않으면 긴급하지 않은 문의가 들어왔을 때\n워크플로우가 <strong>조용히 아무것도 하지 않고</strong> 끝납니다. 오류도 나지 않아서 알아채기 어렵습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"두-안내문-설정하기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#두-안내문-설정하기\" class=\"peer\">두 안내문 설정하기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>두 <code>Agent</code> 모두 <strong><code>Model</code>을 고르고 <code>Messages</code>를 채웁니다.</strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"긴급안내\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#긴급안내\" class=\"peer\">긴급안내</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>System:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>너는 고객 지원 담당자다. 긴급 문의에 대한 안내문을 쓴다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>정중하게, 3문장 이내로, 곧바로 담당자가 연락한다는 내용을 담는다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>User:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>아래 문의에 대한 긴급 안내문을 써 줘.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;start.input&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"일반안내\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#일반안내\" class=\"peer\">일반안내</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>System:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>너는 고객 지원 담당자다. 일반 문의에 대한 접수 안내문을 쓴다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>정중하게, 3문장 이내로, 순서대로 확인해 답변드린다는 내용을 담는다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>User:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>아래 문의에 대한 접수 안내문을 써 줘.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;start.input&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>두 블록 모두 <strong><code>&lt;start.input&gt;</code></strong> 을 씁니다. <code>분류봇</code>을 거쳐 왔지만\n<strong><code>Start</code>의 값도 그대로 쓸 수 있습니다.</strong> 앞에 있는 블록이면 무엇이든 가져다 쓸 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"두-갈래를-모두-확인하기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#두-갈래를-모두-확인하기\" class=\"peer\">두 갈래를 모두 확인하기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><strong>한 번만 돌려 보고 끝내면 안 됩니다.</strong> 갈래가 둘이니 <strong>두 번</strong> 시험합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>Start</code>의 <code>Value</code>에 긴급한 문의를 넣고 <code>Run</code>.</strong></p><figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>결제했는데 서비스가 안 열립니다. 지금 급합니다.</span></span></code></pre></div></figure><p><code>Terminal</code>에 <code>긴급안내</code>가 실행된 줄이 보여야 합니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>Value</code>를 보통 문의로 바꾸고 다시 <code>Run</code>.</strong></p><figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>요금제 종류가 궁금합니다.</span></span></code></pre></div></figure><p>이번에는 <code>일반안내</code>가 실행되어야 합니다.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>실행이 끝나면 <strong>캔버스의 연결선에 색이 남습니다.</strong> 어느 갈래로 갔는지\n<code>Terminal</code>을 열지 않고도 눈으로 확인할 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"잘-안-될-때\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#잘-안-될-때\" class=\"peer\">잘 안 될 때</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>증상</th><th>원인</th><th>해결</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>늘 <code>else</code> 쪽으로만 간다</td><td>조건이 늘 거짓이다</td><td><code>분류봇</code> 결과에 정말 <code>URGENT</code>가 있는지 <code>Terminal</code>에서 확인합니다</td></tr><tr><td>블록 이름을 잘못 적었다</td><td>참조가 안 맞는다</td><td><code>&lt;</code> 를 눌러 목록에서 다시 고릅니다</td></tr><tr><td>한쪽 갈래가 실행되지 않는다</td><td>그 줄의 점에서 선을 안 이었다</td><td>카드의 줄과 선이 맞게 이어졌는지 봅니다</td></tr><tr><td>두 안내문이 똑같이 나온다</td><td>두 Agent의 <code>Messages</code>가 같다</td><td>각각 다르게 적었는지 확인합니다</td></tr><tr><td>아무 안내문도 안 나온다</td><td><code>else</code>를 안 이었다</td><td><code>else</code> 줄에서 선을 잇습니다</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>2단계 완료입니다.</strong> 워크플로우가 완성됐습니다.\n다시 한번 <strong><code>버전 저장</code></strong> 을 눌러 두고 마지막 단계로 넘어갑니다.</p>"
}